WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.750
On iPhone, tap Record
and choose your patient.

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:06.950
Check the SOAP and discharge
templates before you begin.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.240
noctune includes general
templates, with community and

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.630
custom templates available
for other workflows.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.430
For this visit, we'll use
the general templates.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:17.580
Tap Start Recording.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:21.730
Hold Pause when you need a break,
then tap Resume recording to continue.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.850
When you're finished, hold
Finish and transcribe.

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:27.890
You can also choose an existing
audio file from your phone.

00:00:28.573 --> 00:00:32.003
Once uploaded, your recording
is processed into draft notes.

00:00:32.093 --> 00:00:34.643
Processing continues after
you leave the screen.

00:00:34.733 --> 00:00:36.643
Here's Mochi's example draft.

00:00:37.227 --> 00:00:40.737
Read the SOAP note and check the
patient details, findings, and plan.

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:44.817
Open Transcript and tap a passage
to jump to that point in the audio.

00:00:44.907 --> 00:00:47.537
The draft is a starting point
for your clinical review.

00:00:48.207 --> 00:00:50.837
Tap Edit and make any corrections.

00:00:50.927 --> 00:00:53.477
Here, we're updating a phrase in the plan.

00:00:53.647 --> 00:00:56.277
Preview shows how the
finished note will read.

00:00:56.447 --> 00:00:59.157
Then tap Save and check your change.

00:00:59.247 --> 00:01:01.157
Saving does not complete the encounter.

00:01:01.827 --> 00:01:05.337
Review the Discharge tab,
then open the email composer.

00:01:05.427 --> 00:01:07.897
Every account can send discharge notes.

00:01:07.907 --> 00:01:10.617
Without Nest, no reply is the default.

00:01:10.707 --> 00:01:13.737
Check the recipient and
reply address before sending.

00:01:13.827 --> 00:01:15.497
This example stays unsent.

00:01:16.093 --> 00:01:18.653
To complete the encounter
without sending an email,

00:01:18.653 --> 00:01:20.883
tap the arrow beside the email button.

00:01:20.973 --> 00:01:22.643
Choose Mark as complete.

00:01:22.813 --> 00:01:25.043
Do this only after your
review is finished.

00:01:25.727 --> 00:01:30.037
With noctune Nest, clients reply
through a private relay address.

00:01:30.287 --> 00:01:32.847
Your personal email stays hidden, and

00:01:32.847 --> 00:01:34.997
replies stay linked to the encounter.

00:01:35.247 --> 00:01:38.117
Open Messages to follow up
with the visit in context.
